      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRAVE CALL (8) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 3 lengths into third (20.58) at this track in a Maiden over 350m. Likely to feature again. LONG BAY BLUE (4) was quickly into stride and burnt early from the middle draw where she gave a sight, finishing second (20.44) and beaten one length over 350m at this track. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Must be included in calculations. LIZZY BOOST (7) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (26.08) at this track behind Sandave Mason in a Mix. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Winning chance. WHICH LEGEND (2) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
